\end_inset
 ע"י:
\begin_inset Formula
\[
\MKbbp\left(A\mid B\right):=\MKbbp_{B}\left(A\right):=\begin{cases}
\frac{\MKbbp\left(A\cap B\right)}{\MKbbp\left(B\right)} & \MKbbp\left(B\right)>0\\
0 & \MKbbp\left(B\right)=0
\end{cases}
\]


